	// A digest of the content seen this time, for binding INSTALL.
	//
	// The confirmation screen **must** put it unchanged into InstallRequest.expected_manifest_digest,
	// otherwise the permission list the user saw and the package actually installed may not be the same copy, and the swap in between
	// would leave no trace.
	//
	// It's the hex string of sha256(the raw manifest bytes). The manifest contains every file's
	// digest and is itself covered by the signature, so it identifies the whole package content, with no need to walk the file tree.
